# are in multimodal processing (mm_processor_kwargs code_revision RCE and DoS, the
# multimodal shared-memory handle reaching pickle.loads, EPS image decoding through
# Ghostscript). The eval steps serve a text-only model on 127.0.0.1 inside the job
